I've started - nothing complete yet.

But give your levels to the DevTeam! In my opinion, Nethack needs more
of the human-generated levels. That will add variety to the games - now
the Quest is about the only bigger thing that is different between
games. (Human-generated levels are better because there can be 'puzzles'
to solve and better consistency (like following a certain theme -
Haunted Graveyard or something).)

I think the levels should be included like bigroom and Fort Ludios. If
the DevTeam gets enough of them, do something like select (randomly, at
the start of the game) 3-6 of them for a game.

